7. Security: role checks backend, URL validation, SSRF, SRT size/encoding, no key logging, AI service down handling, per-video failure isolation.
8. Tests: 15 scenarios — at least realistic subset, API tests. Run typecheck/build/backend tests.
9. Report.

Constraints: don't rebuild RAG, no Section table, don't replace VideoPlayer, reuse ingest-text, don't change AI request schema unless minimal.

